     If you have NetHack's "time" option enabled, you might trying turning
it off.  Updating the status line for every turn is bound to slow things
down.  Time (which is really a turn counter, not a clock) is disabled by
default, but the sample nethack.cnf file included with the sources (perhaps
with the binaries too; I don't know) has an OPTIONS line which enables it.



